<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">mind-fog</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Mind Fog</ansi> spell saturates the target's mind with psionic interference,
dulling their perception and sapping their willpower. A fogged enemy
is less aware of their surroundings and less effective in mental
contests.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

::keep
  <ansi fg="command">cast mind-fog [target]</ansi>
::

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

::rows
  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 6
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 50
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — willpower resists the psionic fog
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Weakening effect — lowers target's perception and willpower
::

